      "html": "A modern word, a back-formation from Italian <em>gelato</em>; classically <span lang=\"la\">gelātus</span> is only the participle “frozen, set”. Recorded by Helfer’s Lexicon auxiliare and Vox Latina (via Morgan–Owens’s online index).",
